From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] port the mac80211 locking and timers to 7.x

7.x cfg80211 removed wireless_dev::mtx; the wiphy mutex is the
per-device lock. 7.x also renamed the timer APIs (from_timer,
del_timer, del_timer_sync); map them for this fork.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/include/net/atbm_mac80211.h
+++ b/include/net/atbm_mac80211.h
@@ -14,6 +14,18 @@
 #define ATBM_MAC80211_H
 
 #include <linux/kernel.h>
+#include <linux/timer.h>
+/* 7.x renamed the timer API: map the names this fork uses. */
+#ifndef from_timer
+#define from_timer(var, callback_timer, timer_fieldname) \
+	timer_container_of(var, callback_timer, timer_fieldname)
+#endif
+#ifndef del_timer
+#define del_timer(timer) timer_delete(timer)
+#endif
+#ifndef del_timer_sync
+#define del_timer_sync(timer) timer_delete_sync(timer)
+#endif
 #include <linux/if_ether.h>
 #include <linux/skbuff.h>
 #include <linux/device.h>
